[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 360.71, "timestamp": "00:06:00", "text": "我唯一不想要的就是这个。所以，我会尽量"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 363.59, "timestamp": "00:06:03", "text": "像盖子一样盖住，或者类似的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 365.749, "timestamp": "00:06:05", "text": "或者别的什么。但我担心的是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 369.27, "timestamp": "00:06:09", "text": "空气通道之类的东西，你知道的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 371.51, "timestamp": "00:06:11", "text": "不过，我们看看情况如何吧。主要而言，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 373.59, "timestamp": "00:06:13", "text": "我需要买些东西，比如"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 377.99, "timestamp": "00:06:17", "text": "为这个鱼缸准备一些装饰品，这样我就可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 380.15, "timestamp": "00:06:20", "text": "在直播里炫耀一番什么的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 382.15, "timestamp": "00:06:22", "text": "虽然我现在正在炫耀它，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 384.95, "timestamp": "00:06:24", "text": "不过我仍然需要一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 387.189, "timestamp": "00:06:27", "text": "我需要好好装饰一下它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 390.79, "timestamp": "00:06:30", "text": "比如图纸、石头之类的东西，这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 395.11, "timestamp": "00:06:35", "text": "它看起来很漂亮。不，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 398.23, "timestamp": "00:06:38", "text": "我得去买那个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 401.67, "timestamp": "00:06:41", "text": "那我很有可能会这么做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 403.67, "timestamp": "00:06:43", "text": "是的，"}]